	| Update Summary              | Added Account                 |
	| Update Date                 | Today                         |
	| Update Field Name           | phoneNumber                   |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                           |
	| Update Field New Value      | 555-555-5678                  |
	And the history entry with the keyword "Added Account" with the field value "name" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki QA Service Producer |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account                 |
	| Update Date                 | Today                         |
	| Update Field Name           | name                          |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                           |
	| Update Field New Value      | Korone - ${staticProjectName} |
	And the history entry with the keyword "Added Account" with the field value "faxNumber" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki QA Service Producer |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account                 |
	| Update Date                 | Today                         |
	| Update Field Name           | faxNumber                     |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                           |
	| Update Field New Value      | 555-555-1234                  |
	And the history entry with the keyword "Added Account" with the field value "profileEmailAddress" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki QA Service Producer        |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account                        |
	| Update Date                 | Today                                |
	| Update Field Name           | profileEmailAddress                  |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                  |
	| Update Field New Value      | osb.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And the history entry with the keyword "Added Account" with the field value "status" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki QA Service Producer |
	| Update Summary              | Added Account                 |
	| Update Date                 | Today                         |
